---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Support" description="Human support for Dashless accounts, billing, and hosted blogs.">
  <article class="dl-legal-page dl-support-page">
    <header class="dl-legal-header">
      <p class="dl-eyebrow">A HUMAN, WHEN YOU NEED ONE</p>
      <h1>Support</h1>
      <p class="dl-legal-intro">For account, billing, or site recovery help, tell us what happened and include your blog address. Never send passwords or payment details.</p>
    </header>
    <section class="dl-support-card">
      <h2>Let’s sort it out.</h2>
      <p>We’ll help with sign in, billing questions, publishing problems, and recovering a hosted blog.</p>
      <a class="dl-paper-button" href="mailto:howdy@regionallyfamous.com">Contact support <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
    </section>
    <p class="dl-legal-contact"><a href="/privacy/">Privacy notice</a> · <a href="/terms/">Terms</a></p>
  </article>
</Layout>
